# Frontend - build-time configuration.
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env` IN THIS SAME FOLDER (frontend/.env):
#        copy .env.example .env
# 2. Uncomment and edit only if you need to.
#
# `.env` is git-ignored. Vite only exposes variables prefixed with `VITE_` to
# browser code, so anything here is PUBLIC - never put a secret in this file.
#
# Everything below is optional: the app already defaults to
# http://localhost:8000, which is where the orchestrator API runs.

# Where the Global Orchestrator's HTTP API is reachable.
# Read by frontend/src/lib/orchestrator-client.ts.
# VITE_ORCHESTRATOR_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
